# What moved, for kyoten:
#   80390dde (0.9.957): every `static` states its start (none here lacks one).
#   ea48eccb (0.9.958, breaking): `run(app:, pace:)` takes a required `Pace` (`EveryRefresh`, `AtMost(hz:)`,
#           `OnDemand`), and an app on demand ticks only when woken (KR-281 4g). The five calls are ported, each
#           `Pace::EveryRefresh`, as it ran: @kama/gpu's tests and two examples (kama-gpu 542789b), @kama/window's tests
#           (kama-window dfe07c4) and @kama/graphics' tests (kama-graphics 5f494fa), their manifests needing 0.9.958.
#           A window package may install its own wait for an app on demand (`setEventWait`); @kama/window does not yet.
#   f149c7e6 (0.9.959): a web connection's arrival wakes an app on demand.
#   f2c8b31b (0.9.960): an operator's by-value operand is handed over as a call's argument is (KY-59, fixed and
